    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amazia kūbiza ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa kabīlī go ng'wa Yehoashi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoahazi ntemi wa Isilaeli, Amazia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yoashi ūbiza ntemi wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alandya kūbiza ntemi walī na myaka makūmi abīlī n'ītanò; ūsuga alī mu Yelusalemu ikanza lya myaka makūmi abīlī na kenda. Ū nina witanagwa Yehoadini, muna Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Amazia akīīta yawiza ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA; gwike atashikile ūmo walī ū nkūlūgenji wakwe ū Daūdi. Ū mu mihayo yose walondeelaga kashimīzīle ka ng'wa ise Yoashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a mapandī ga higūlya gatīnjiwe; a banhū baalī bataalī būja koi kūfunya shitambò na kūzuukīja būbbani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Amazia aho wabona gīkī wabūdima chiza ū būsugi, ūbabūlaga a batūmami ba mu būsugi bokwe abo baalī bamūlaga ū ntemi ū ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bitūnja ba babūlagi benabo atababūlagile, nguno h'ūmo handīkīlilwe ū mu shitabo sha shilagīlo sha ng'wa Musa; ūmo SEEBA alagīlile, “A babyaji yaya ū kūbūlagwa kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi wa baana babo, na a baana batizūbūlagwa kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi wa babyaji babo; būlī munhū akūcha kūlwa būhūbi wakwe wei ng'wenekīlī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Amazia hū ng'wene ūyo akabapyena bana Edomu mu sī ya ntubīlo; īyo yalī sī ya munhu, ūbabūlaga banhū shihūmbī ikūmi ū mubo. Nū nzengo gwa Sela ūgūdima, ūgūgalūcha ī lina gūbiza Yokiseli, lina īlo na lelo lītaalī līkūtūmamaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amazia kūpyenwa mu būlūgū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Amazia ūtwala nhūng'wa kūlī ntemi wa Isilaeli ū Yehoashi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoahazi, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehu; ūng'wīla, “Nzūgū tūpamanye būshū kū būshū ū bebe nū nene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yehoashi ūnshokeja ū Amazia ū ntemi wa Yuda ūng'wīla, “Kagwaata kalebe kakigīmba gīmba ng'wipoolu lya Lebanoni, kūtwala mhola kū ntī gwa manga ū mu Lebanoni ng'wenūmo; kūlagīja kalīhaya, ‘Nfunyage ū nshīke wako atoolwe na ng'witūnja wane!’ Alīyo kwimanīla shiinū ya muumo Lebanoni ng'wenūmo yūbītīla ī mhandī jenījo, yūkapandagīla a kagwaata kenako! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gashi īkī wabapyenile bana Edomu hū wītile lūgiili giili. Bebe ni wayegela būtindi wako dūhū, wikale kū ng'wako kwenūko! Ī gete waseeseelilwe kī, nose ūlīhaya kwiyenheleja makoye ga kūkūgwisha ū bebe nī Yuda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Amazia atigwiile, nose ū Yehoashi ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūbūūka kūjūndumīla; na ng'hana ū wei nū Amazia ū ntemi wa Yuda būpamanya būshū kū būshū balī Beti-shemeshi mu sī ya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Yuda yūpyenwa kībi no na a Baisilaeli, būlī munhū ūpeela ashokile kū ng'wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balī ū mu būlūgū wa Beti-shemeshi wenūbo, ū Yehoashi ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūndima ū Amazia ū ntemi wa Yuda, ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yoashi, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahazia. Hanuma ū Yehoashi ūja ī Yelusalemu ūūkīgwisha ī ndugu ya Yelusalemu kwandīja kū mita gwa Efulaimu kūja kū mita gwa kuluba, ibbala lya būlīhu wa fuuti magana atandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī zahabu nī feza ūjisola, pyī nī shikolo ī shingī īsho akapandīka kūfuma mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, nū kūfuma ū mu mabīkīlo ga sabo ga mu numba y'ikūlū. Ūdima na banhū ūbajana aho alīshoka Samalia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha kwa ng'wa Yehoashi na Amazia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Yehoashi, īyo wīta nī ya būtindi wakwe, pyī nī ya būlūgū wakwe ūbo akalwa na Amazia ntemi wa Yuda, ī yose yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoashi wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkwa mu nzengo gwa Samalia, hamò na batemi ba Isilaeli. Ng'witūnja wakwe Yeloboamu wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Amazia, ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yoashi, ū ntemi wa Yuda, akikala alīho mpanga kūshisha ikanza lya myaka ikūmi n'ītanò, a ha numa ya kūcha kwa ng'wa Yehoashi ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoahazi ū ntemi wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Amazia yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana Yelusalemu būnīīla gwīnda ya kūhaya kūmūlaga, aho wadeeba ūtoloka ūpeelela Lakishi, alīyo būtūma banhū būnkūūbīja ī Lakishi būūkamūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna wenhwa ha falasa wiza ūjīkwa mu Yelusalemu hamò na bakūlūgenji bakwe mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma a banhū ba Yuda a bose būnsola ng'witūnja wakwe Azalia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Azalia:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, Uzia.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " būntemya a ha ng'wanya gwa ng'wa ise ū Amazia; walī na myaka ikūmi n'ītandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wifuula ū Amazia hamò na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ū Azalia ūgūshosha ū nzengo gwa Elasi mu būsugi wa Yuda, nīyo ūgūzenga būpya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeloboamu wa kabīlī, kūtema Isilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gw'ikūmi n'īnè go ng'wa Amazia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yoashi ntemi wa Yuda, Yeloboamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoashi ūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli mu Samalia; ūsuga ikanza lya myaka makūmi anè na gūmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe wīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, atalekanile nū būhūbi bo ng'wa Yeloboamu ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati, ūbo walī wabenheleja a Baisilaeli kūhūba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū ng'wene ūyo akalūshosha ū lūbīmbī lwa sī ya Isilaeli kūfuma Lebo lūūkashika kū nyanza ya Alaba, kūlenganīla na mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli; ūmo walī wayombela mu nzīla ya ntūmami wakwe Yona ng'witūnja o ng'wa Amitai, ūyo walī ng'hangi wa Gaasi-hefa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA akabūbona ū būbi wa būluhi ūmo būlī munhū waluhīlaga ū mu Baisilaeli, abize nsese nūūlū alī mu wiyaabī; walī atīho ose ose ū wa kūbagunanha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū īkī ū SEEBA walī atahayile gīkī akūlīpyagūla līshile ho gete ī lina lya Baisilaeli ū mu sī, akabapīja mu nzīla ya nkono go ng'wa Yeloboamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Yeloboamu yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli; pyī īyo wīta nī ya būtindi wa mabità gakwe mu būlūgū, nū mumo akīshokeja mu sī ya Isilseli mizengo ya Damasiko na Hamasi īyo yalī ya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yeloboamu wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, a batemi ba Isilaeli; ng'witūnja wakwe Zakalia ūbiza ntemi a ha ng'wanya gwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
